# {{project_name}}

{{description}}

This template bootstraps a pnpm monorepo managed with Lerna and Nx. It includes:

- shared TypeScript configuration at the repository root
- Jest for unit and integration testing
- ESLint and Prettier for linting and formatting
- Husky hooks for local guardrails
- GitHub Actions for CI
- AGD starter docs for design, memory, config, and progress tracking

## Layout

```text
.
├── AGENTS.md
├── README.md
├── config.md
├── design.md
├── docs/
│   ├── .archive/
│   └── spec-01-monorepo-foundation.md
├── memory.md
├── progress.md
├── packages/
│   ├── client/
│   ├── common/
│   ├── db/
│   ├── integration/
│   ├── scripts/
│   └── server/
└── tsconfig.json
```

## Commands

- `pnpm build`: build every workspace package through Lerna
- package builds use TypeScript project references so cross-package imports compile cleanly
- `pnpm dev`: run package watch tasks in parallel
- `pnpm clean`: remove build output and Nx cache artifacts
- `pnpm format`: format the repo with Prettier
- `pnpm lint`: lint every package through Nx
- `pnpm test`: run unit and integration tests through Nx and Jest

## Testing Conventions

- Unit tests live in `packages/*/test`
- Cross-package integration tests live in `packages/integration/test`

## Getting Started

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm build
pnpm test
```
